            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.74

- Apple Podcasts now works. The overlay was not appearing for it at all, because Podcasts labels every episode as video, audio-only ones included, and anything labelled video was being turned away. Episodes are now recognised by content type instead, so a podcast shows its show art, title, episode and progress like anything else, with the usual controls.
- Removed a check that ran against Podcasts on every update and could never succeed, since Podcasts offers nothing for it to query.
]]></description>
